# =============================================================================
# 70-storage-nas.list.chroot - SMB shares, discovery, pooling, parity, disks
# =============================================================================
# What: Samba with its VFS modules (catia, fruit, streams_xattr, recycle),
#       Windows and macOS discovery, mergerfs pooling, SMART monitoring and
#       the file-system tools the Storage tab uses (required).
# Why:  spec Tab C (runtime packages). Trixie has no wsdd package; wsdd2
#       provides the same Windows network discovery (docs/PLAN.md NOTE-51).
# Format rules: see 10-base.list.chroot.
# =============================================================================

# SMB server, VFS modules, client (used by the "Test connection" button)
samba
samba-vfs-modules
smbclient

# Network discovery: Windows Explorer (WS-Discovery) and macOS Finder (mDNS)
wsdd2
avahi-daemon

# Pooling (SnapRAID for scheduled parity is in 75-storage-optional)
mergerfs

# Disk health, partitioning and file systems
smartmontools
parted
btrfs-progs
xfsprogs
e2fsprogs
exfatprogs
ntfs-3g
